Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:14:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] UI pass: speaking-card GD topic, reading progress, icon
 actions

- GD topic styled as a cue card; opening and closing lines side by side on desktop
- Stakeholder lenses split into name and view
- Sticky bar with section chips plus reading progress; chips tick off when a section is read
- Opening the full story marks it read; read stories dim instead of fading out
- Save, read and share are icon buttons; saved stories move to a header button with a count
- One Expand/Collapse toggle; masthead kicker in sentence case

